",{"children":["本文将实现的应用叫 HTTPie，HTTPie 是一个用 Python 编写的命令行 HTTP 客户端，其目标是使 CLI 与 web 服务的交互尽可能愉快。它被设计为一个 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"curl"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"wget"}]," 的替代品，提供易于使用的界面和一些用户友好的功能，如 JSON 支持、语法高亮和插件。它对于测试、调试和通常与 HTTP 服务器或 RESTful API 进行交云的开发人员来说非常有用。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"HTTPie 的一些关键特性包括："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"JSON 支持"}],"：默认情况下，HTTPie 会自动发送 JSON，并且可以轻松地通过命令行发送 JSON 请求体。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"语法高亮"}],"：它会为 HTTP 响应输出提供语法高亮显示，使得结果更加易于阅读。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"插件"}],"：HTTPie 支持插件，允许扩展其核心功能。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"表单和文件上传"}],"：可以很容易地通过表单上传文件。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"自定义 HTTP 方法和头部"}],"：可以发送任何 HTTP 方法的请求，自定义请求头部。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-5",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"HTTPS、代理和身份验证支持"}],"：支持 HTTPS 请求、使用代理以及多种 HTTP 身份验证机制。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-6",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"流式上传和下载"}],"：支持大文件的流式上传和下载。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-7",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"会话支持"}],"：可以保存和重用常用的请求和集合。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":["本文我们将实现其中的 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"1"}],"、",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"2"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"5"}],"。我们会支持发送 GET 和 POST 请求，其中 POST 支持设置请求头和 JSON 数据。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"在本文中，你可以学习到："}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["如何用 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"clap"}]," 解析命令行参数。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["如何用 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"tokio"}]," 进行异步编程。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["如何用 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"reqwest"}]," 发送 HTTP 请求。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["如何用 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"colored"}]," 在终端输出带颜色的内容。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":["如何用 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"jsonxf"}]," 美化 json 字符串。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-5",{"children":["如何用 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"anyhow"}]," 配合 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"?"}]," 进行错误传播。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-6",{"children":["如何使用 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"HTTPie"}]," 来进行 HTTP 接口测试。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n","$L8","\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n","$L40","\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43","\n","$L44","\n","$L45","\n","$L46","\n","$L47","\n","$L48","\n","$L49","\n","$L4a","\n","$L4b","\n","$L4c","\n","$L4d","\n","$L4e","\n","$L4f","\n","$L50","\n","$L51","\n","$L52","\n","$L53","\n","$L54","\n","$L55","\n","$L56","\n","$L57","\n","$L58","\n","$L59","\n","$L5a","\n","$L5b","\n","$L5c"]}]}],"$L5d","$L5e","$L5f"]}],"$L60"]}]]}]}]
